  "solution": "**Given**\n\n180 ÷ 20 {(15 – 6) + (24 – 18)} \n\n**Concept**\n\nBODMAS\n\n**Calculation**\n\n180 ÷ 20 {(15 – 6) + (24 – 18)} is\n\n180 ÷ 20 {(9 + 6)}\n\n⇒ 180 ÷ 20 (15)\n\n⇒ 180 ÷ 300\n\n \n\n⇒ 180 × (1/300)\n\n \n\n⇒ 18/30\n\n \n\n⇒ 9/15\n\n**∴ The value of 180 ÷ 20 {(15 – 6) + (24 – 18)} is 9/15.**",
